      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olunaku lwa Musengwa Katonda lw'alisaliraku omusango luli kwidha, olwo abazigu banhage ebintu byaimwe era babigabane nga mulingiriire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda akoba ati alisoloza abantu b'amaghanga goonagoona, baalumba Yerusalemu mu lutalo. Balikighangula, baanhagulula ebintu mu mayumba, era baagema abakazi baabakaka. Ekitundu ku bantu baamu balitwalibwa mu bunhage, aye abalisigalagho tibalitoolebwa mu kibuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda alimala yaalumba amaghanga ago, yaagalwanisa ng'oti bwe yalwana mu ntalo edhaabita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kiseera ekyo alyemerera ku Lusozi olw'Emiti Emyoliva, oluli ku luuyi olw'e buvandhuba olwa Yerusalemu. Olusozi olwo lulyeyatisaamu endhawu ibiri okuva e buvandhuba okutuuka e bugwandhuba, lwaidhamu ekiiko ekigazi einho. Olwawu olundi olw'olusozi olwo luliseseetukira ku luuyi olw'omukono omugooda olw'e buvandhuba, ate olwawu olundi lwaseseetukira ku luuyi olw'omukono omusaadha olw'e buvandhuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muliwona nga mubitira mu kiiko ekyo ekirigabaniamu olusozi aghabiri. Mulirumuka nga badhaadha baimwe bwe baakola ku lule musisi lwe yabita mu biseera bya kyabazinga Uzzia ow'e Buyudaaya. Agho Musengwa Katonda waife aliidha ng'ali ghalala n'abatukuvu boonaboona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kiseera ekyo teribaayo kiinhogogo waire olufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era teribaayo nzikiiza. Bulibanga musana ekiseera kyonakyona. Ni mu kiseera eky'obwire, ghalibangagho butangaavu ng'oti musana. Aye Musengwa Katonda yenka naidhi ekiseera ekyo ghe kiribeeragho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
