            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.47.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezek 47:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.7.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoa 7:38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kwol 22:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mu kiseera ekyo amaadhi amalungi galikuuluula nga gava mu Yerusalemu. Galyegabamu ghabiri agandi gaaja mu nhandha eri e buvandhuba, ate agandi gaaja mu nhandha eri e bugwandhuba. Galikuuluula omwaka gwonagwona nga tigalekera, ka bibe ebiseera eby'akasana oba eby'ekiinhogogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda n'aliba Kyabazinga ow'ensi yoonayoona, abantu boonaboona baamusinzanga nga ni Musengwa Katonda yenka ye baidhi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiketezo kyonakyona ekiri ku luuyi olw'omukono omusaadha olw'e buvandhuba olwa Yerusalemu, okuva e Geba okutuuka e Rimmoni, kirifuulibwa museetwe mwereere. Aye Yerusalemu kirisigala mu kifo kyakyo nga kiri ghaigulu okuwula ebiketezo byonabyona ebikyezungulwire. Era ekibuga ekyo kiriva ku gwetebwa Omulyango gwa Benjamini, kyaja kyatuuka ku gwetebwa Omulyango ogw'omu Nsonda aghaali omulyango omukaire, era kyatuuka ku kyetebwa Ekituuti ekya Hananeli, ni ku bikunhiro bya kyabazinga eby'omwenge ogw'emizabbibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kwol 22:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abantu balibanga mu Yerusalemu nga bali mu miraala, kuba baliba tibakeeraliikirira kuzikirizibwa olw'ekikolimo okuba ku kibuga ekyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda alibonereza abantu b'amaghanga agalitanula olutalo ku Yerusalemu, ng'abasindikira endwaire embi einho: emibiri gyaibwe girivunda nga bakaatambula, amaiso gaibwe gaabavundira mu bighanga, n'enimi dhaibwe dhaabavundira mu kanwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kiseera ekyo Musengwa Katonda alibaleetera okwezinduka einho, baasoberwa n'okusoberwa. Olwo buli muntu yaagema mwine amuli okumpi, yaamulwanisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'abantu ab'omu Bayudaaya boona balirwanisa abazigu abo ku lwa Yerusalemu. Balisoloza eby'obukombe eby'amaghanga agandi nga bingi inho: zaabu, feeza, n'engoye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:14"
