        {
          "text": "Entamu dhoonadhoona mu Yerusalemu ni mu Buyudaaya dhiryawulibwa nga dha Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye. Olwo abaja okughaayo emisengo balitoolanga ku edho baafumbamu emamba ey'omusengo. Mu kiseera ekyo, mu isinzizo lya Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye timulibaamu kabiri musuubuzi waire omulala ati.",
